WEBVTT

00:04:59.253 --> 00:05:00.713
And that's what gives me hope,

00:05:00.755 --> 00:05:04.425
because we have the means
to evolve further.

00:05:04.467 --> 00:05:06.719
And that's AI.

00:05:06.761 --> 00:05:10.097
Now look, I don't mean
the geeks will inherit the earth.

00:05:10.139 --> 00:05:12.016
I'm sorry, geeks. You won't.

00:05:12.058 --> 00:05:13.059
(Laughter)

00:05:13.059 --> 00:05:16.729
I don’t really want to talk about narrow-
goal artificial intelligence at all.

00:05:16.729 --> 00:05:19.565
That term of John McCarthy’s,
“artificial intelligence,”

00:05:19.565 --> 00:05:21.525
is it any use to us now?

00:05:21.525 --> 00:05:25.446
I'd rather call it
alternative intelligence.

00:05:25.446 --> 00:05:30.951
And I think humankind is in need
of some alternative intelligence.